{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47534","headline":"七言 四十三 · 吕岩","name":"七言 四十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫极宫中我自知，亲磨神剑剑还飞。\n先差玉子开南殿，後遣青龙入紫微。\n九鼎黄芽栖瑞凤，一躯仙骨养灵芝。\n蓬莱不是凡人处，只怕愚人泄世机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}